# Playful Picks - Project Memory

## Overview

E-commerce web app for children's toys/products (totebag brand). Bilingual (EN/FR), Supabase backend, Stripe payments, shipping integration. Originally scaffolded via Lovable.dev, now maintained locally.

- **Lovable project**: `3923f859-5de7-429d-b09a-7e8f16b14485`
- **Supabase project**: `ktmqwhkywxogxktuqcfx`
- **Deploy target**: Netlify (SPA fallback in `netlify.toml`)
- **Dev server**: `localhost:8080`

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Framework | React 18 + TypeScript |
| Bundler | Vite 5 (SWC plugin, terser minify, vendor chunk split) |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS 3 + `tailwindcss-animate` |
| UI Library | shadcn/ui (Radix primitives + CVA + lucide-react icons) |
| State | React Context + TanStack React Query v5 |
| Routing | react-router-dom v6 (`BrowserRouter` + `Routes`) |
| Backend | Supabase (Postgres, Auth, Edge Functions, Realtime) |
| Forms | react-hook-form + zod validation |
| Animations | framer-motion |
| i18n | Custom `LanguageContext` with JSON locale files (`en.json`, `fr.json`) |
| Payments | Stripe (via Supabase Edge Function `create-checkout` + `stripe-webhook`) |
| Shipping | Supabase Edge Function `shipping` |
| Charts | Recharts (admin dashboard) |
| HTTP | axios (Mapbox), Supabase JS client (everything else) |

