## Known Issues / Tech Debt

- `@tanstack/react-query` is in devDependencies but used at runtime (should be in dependencies)
- `axios` is duplicated in both dependencies and devDependencies
- `@ckeditor/vite-plugin-ckeditor5` is unused (no imports found)
- `router.tsx` (createBrowserRouter) is not wired - App.tsx uses BrowserRouter
- `@tailwindcss/typography` in devDeps but not registered in tailwind.config.ts plugins
- `ThemeProvider` from `next-themes` not wired in App.tsx (dark mode incomplete)
- Supabase anon key and Mapbox token are hardcoded in source (anon key is public-by-design)
- `src/supabase/functions/` duplicates parts of root `supabase/functions/` (likely stale)
- No automated tests (no test runner, no test files)
- No `.env.example` file
- Vite timestamp cache files at root should be gitignored

